# Copy to smb-hosts.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Format: share_name|reserved_lan_ipv4|smb_user
# Do NOT commit smb-hosts.local.
#
#   cp scripts/smb-hosts.example scripts/smb-hosts.local
#
# Prefer reserved IPv4 over *.local (same reason as SSH: mDNS fails on
# travel-router / cross-subnet). Password stays in macOS Keychain after
# the first successful Finder/open mount.
#
# Example (placeholders only):
projects|YOUR_NAS_IPV4|YOUR_SMB_USER
backups|YOUR_NAS_IPV4|YOUR_SMB_USER
romm|YOUR_ROMM_NAS_IPV4|YOUR_SMB_USER
